WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.199 --> 00:00:05.279
What happens when you place a Legend of Zelda
NES cartridge into the SCP-914?

00:00:05.279 --> 00:00:09.690
Professor Wren placed the NES cartridge for
the game, "The Legend of Zelda II: The Adventure

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:12.429
of Link," into the Clockworks on the setting
"Rough."

00:00:12.429 --> 00:00:16.830
The output produced was a pile of melted plastic
with bits of circuit board parts sticking

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:17.830
out of it.

00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:21.940
Professor Wren added this note to the experiment
log: "I'll admit there was a slight vendetta

00:00:21.940 --> 00:00:22.940
here.

00:00:22.940 --> 00:00:26.320
The battery that kept save files alive in
these older games died on me right as I finally

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:28.690
reached the last dungeon for the first time."

